OL,3,GNEWSAOutdoor swimming pool to get #1.1m
OL,4,Aupgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn ageing outdoor swimming pool is to
OL,7,Fget a #1.1m upgrade to keep it running.
OL,9,FHaltwhistle Swimming Pool, in
OL,10,FNorthumberland, attracts tens of
OL,11,Fthousands of visitors a year but parts
OL,12,Fof the facility date back to the 1970s,
OL,13,Fwhen it first opened.
OL,15,FNorthumberland City Council approved
OL,16,Fthe plans after a report said without
OL,17,Fintervention there was an increasing
OL,18,Frisk of equipment failure, resulting in
OL,19,Fhigher maintenance costs, and work is
OL,20,Fto begin by the end of the year.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
