OL,3,GNEWSAOutdoor swimming pool to get #1.1m
OL,4,Aupgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil deputy leader Richard Wearmouth
OL,7,Fsaid it would give the pool the
OL,8,Fequipment "it needs to last for the
OL,9,Fnext 30 to 40 years".
